      "message_index": 561,
      "sentence": "Exactly!"
     },
     {
      "start": 59794,
      "end": 59904,
      "message_index": 561,
      "sentence": "It's all about creating a positive and engaging work environment that encourages employees to stay and thrive."
     },
     {
      "start": 59905,
      "end": 60038,
      "message_index": 561,
      "sentence": "Now, one of the key aspects of a meaningful exit interview is ensuring confidentiality and creating a safe space for honest feedback."
